      "title": "REM Performance Entry Series – Side Mount Intercooler V1 (1.8T / 1.9 TDI MK4 Platform)",
      "short": "",
      "descriptionHtml": "<h3 data-end=\"578\" data-start=\"546\">REM Performance Entry Series</h3>\n<p data-end=\"715\" data-start=\"580\">Entry Series predstavuje cenovo dostupné performance riešenia pre upravené vozidlá.<br data-end=\"666\" data-start=\"663\">Určené pre street buildy a základné stage úpravy.</p>\n<p data-end=\"770\" data-start=\"717\">Tento hliníkový side mount intercooler je vhodný ako:</p>\n<ul data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"771\">\n<li data-end=\"809\" data-start=\"771\">\n<p data-end=\"809\" data-start=\"773\">náhrada za unavený OEM intercooler</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"810\">\n<p data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"812\">upgrade pri Stage 1</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"834\">\n<p data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"836\">mierne Stage 2 nastavenie</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"972\" data-start=\"865\">Pomáha stabilizovať teplotu nasávaného vzduchu a zlepšiť konzistentnosť výkonu pri zvýšenom plniacom tlaku.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"974\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"979\">Technické vlastnosti</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"1095\" data-start=\"1005\">\n<li data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"1005\">\n<p data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"1007\">Celohliníková konštrukcia</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"1035\">\n<p data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"1037\">Zvárané spoje</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"1074\" data-start=\"1053\">\n<p data-end=\"1074\" data-start=\"1055\">Performance jadro</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"1095\" data-start=\"1075\">\n<p data-end=\"1095\" data-start=\"1077\">OEM štýl montáže</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-end=\"1100\" data-start=\"1097\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1119\" data-start=\"1102\">Kompatibilita</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"1192\" data-start=\"1121\">\n<li data-end=\"1141\" data-start=\"1121\">\n<p data-end=\"1141\" data-start=\"1123\">VW Golf MK4 1.8T</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1142\">\n<p data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1144\">VW Golf MK4 1.9 TDI</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"1180\" data-start=\"1166\">\n<p data-end=\"1180\" data-start=\"1168\">Audi A3 8L</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"1192\" data-start=\"1181\">\n<p data-end=\"1192\" data-start=\"1183\">VW Bora</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"1234\" data-start=\"1194\">Odporúčame overiť rozmery pred montážou.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"1239\" data-start=\"1236\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1259\" data-start=\"1241\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Upozornenie</span></h3>\n<p data-end=\"1410\" data-start=\"1261\">Entry Series nie je určená pre vysokovýkonné track buildy alebo extrémne boost nastavenia.<br data-end=\"1354\" data-start=\"1351\">Pre vyššie výkony odporúčame vyššiu sériu intercoolerov.</p>",
